    "title": "Anthropic、インドAI市場へ本格進出 元Microsoft幹部を責任者に迎えOpenAIと競争激化（ビジネス＋IT）",
    "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE5aTld0NDFQaEFSd1ljLU1OaU9PdHJtaDFZSC1wOGdnSDRSWEd6YWxLRjR4eWoyc1pOWjRnYlA2TzRLN0ZwSFowbTVsUWJNSkZpSXBsY2h3NlRpVXVQS3ZMMTdDYjJneHhaZGZfNDE4VWt6aFJPaGtxNWE3WjZpV1U?oc=5",
